{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12993","headline":"送陈王府张长史还京 · 独孤及","name":"送陈王府张长史还京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"论齿弟兄列，爲邦前後差。\n十年方一见，此别复何嗟。\n极目故关道，伤心南浦花。\n少时相忆处，招手望行车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}